# Agent tooling. Not part of the product, and not published with it.
#
# It was tracked for a while, on the argument that a hook deciding what leaves
# this machine is a security control and belongs under review. The owner's call
# is that development tooling stays on the machine it runs on. Nothing is
# deleted locally — this only stops it being uploaded.
.claude/
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/CLAUDE.md

# Backups are evidence of a drill, not artefacts of the repository.
.backups/
